# CQ-07 (unknown part): For which instruments could applicability not be determined, and which facts are missing?
SELECT ?instrument ?condition WHERE {
  ?a a {{ApplicabilityAssessment}} ; {{concernsOrganisation}} ?org ; {{applicabilityOf}} ?instrument ;
     {{hasApplicabilityState}} {{AppUnknown}} ; {{conditionUndetermined}} ?condition .
} ORDER BY ?instrument ?condition
